                                                                                  |"},"305":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1#命令注册","content":"type: {\n  \"description\": {\n    description: \"命令的简短描述\",\n    required: true,\n    type: \"string\",\n  },\n  \"scope\": {\n    description: '命令的运行环境',\n    type: <code>string | string[]</code>,\n    default: <code>\"all\"</code>,\n    parameters: [\n      { name: 'all', description: <span>所有场景都能使用<code>\"all\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'private', description: <span>只能在私聊中使用<code>\"private\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'group', description: <span>只能在群组中使用<code>\"group\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'channel', description: <span>只能在频道中使用<code>\"channel\"</code></span> },\n    ],\n\n  },\n  \"permission\": {\n    description: '命令的调用权限',\n    type: <code>\"all\" | \"admin\" | \"owner\"</code>,\n    default: <code>\"all\"</code>,\n    parameters: [\n      { name: 'owner', description: <span>只有超级管理员能使用<code>\"owner\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'admin', description: <span>管理员和超级管理员都能使用<code>\"admin\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'all', description: <span>所有人都能使用<code>\"all\"</code> （注:如果为<code>user</code>账户 即使为<code>\"all\"</code> 的情况下也只会回应 <code>主人</code> 和 <code>管理员</code> 以及 <code>自身</code> 的命令请求）</span> },\n    ],\n  },\n  \"showInHelp\":{\n  \tdescription: \"该命令是否在帮助列表中显示\",\n    type: \"boolean\",\n    default: <code>true</code>,\n  },\n  \"handler\": {\n    description: \"命令处理器\",\n    required: true,\n    type: <code>(updateNewMessage: updateNewMessage, args: string[]) =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;</code>,\t\t\n  }\n}"},"306":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1#命令注册","content":"可以使用我们 TDLib 封装方法或者 TDLib 的原始调用方法来调用 TDLib 方法 文档。"},"307":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1#命令注册","content":"title: 元数据写在哪"},"308":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1#命令注册","content":"type: info"},"309":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/1#命令注册","content":"包插件：复用 package.json 的 name / version / description，插件类型写在 pluginType。\n单文件插件：写在类字段上。见插件迁移指南。"},"310":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2","type":"page","content":"更新事件注册","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发指南","开始","插件开发帮助"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2"},"311":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2","content":"命令注册方法"},"312":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2#更新事件注册","content":"更新事件注册"},"313":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2#更新事件注册","content":"updateHandlers: Record<string, UpdateDef>：TDLib 更新处理表，仅在需要接收更新时运行处理器"},"314":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/2#更新事件注册","content":"所有的更新都可以在TDLib Update 文档。中查找到"},"315":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3","type":"page","content":"插件初始化","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发指南","开始","插件开发帮助"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3"},"316":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3","content":"插件注册时立即执行"},"317":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/3#被注册时立即执行","content":"被注册时立即执行"},"318":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4","type":"page","content":"定时任务","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发指南","开始","插件开发帮助"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4"},"319":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4","content":"定时任务使用方法"},"320":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/4#定时任务","content":"定时任务"},"321":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","type":"page","content":"图片生成","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发指南","开始","插件开发帮助"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5"},"322":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","content":"进行图片生成"},"323":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#介绍","content":"介绍"},"324":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"须知事项"},"325":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"使用方法"},"326":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#返回处理","content":"返回处理"},"327":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#介绍","content":"图片生成主要依靠 satori 进行生成图片"},"328":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#介绍","content":"可以将 Vue 模板渲染成图片"},"329":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"x-satori 负责把最终的静态 HTML 渲染为图片，它不会执行或运行 Vue 组件中的 JavaScript（例如 <script> 内的逻辑、响应式状态或生命周期钩子），也不会处理组件范围内的 <style>（包括 scoped/style modules）。因此，仅依赖组件内脚本或样式来生成最终效果通常不会生效。"},"330":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"由于 satori 并不完整地应用组件级样式，单纯依靠 class 引入的样式通常不可预期。satori 对部分 Tailwind CSS 类有内置支持，但支持范围有限且可能随版本变化，使用前请务必自行测试。如果你在 class 中使用 Tailwind，请在目标环境中验证样式是否生效。"},"331":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"要保证样式在图片中生效，推荐将关键样式写为内联样式（例如 style=\"...\"），或者在渲染前把模板预渲染为包含最终样式的静态 HTML 再交给 satori。可以参考 satori 的 CSS 支持列表来确认哪些 CSS 属性被支持"},"332":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"title: satori 支持的 CSS 列表（参考）"},"333":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#须知事项","content":"https://github.com/vercel/satori?tab=readme-ov-file#css"},"334":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"在 @function/genImg.ts 中 我们包装了一个 generateImage 方法用于图片生成"},"335":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"下面是 generateImage 方法的类型表，使用项目内置的 TypeTable 组件展示参数说明与返回值："},"336":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"type: {\n  \"options\": {\n    description: \"图片生成选项对象\",\n    type: <code>{`{ width: number | 'auto'; height: number | 'auto'; fonts?: FontOptions[]; debug?: boolean; quality?: number; imgname?: string; format?: 'png' | 'jpg' | 'jpeg'; jpegQuality?: number }`}</code>,\n    parameters: [\n      { name: 'width', description: <span>图片宽度，数字或字符串 <code>\"auto\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'height', description: <span>图片高度，数字或字符串 <code>\"auto\"</code></span> },\n      { name: 'fonts', description: <span>字体配置数组，详见 <code>FontOptions</code></span> },\n      { name: 'debug', description: '是否打开调试模式，调试模式下会保留中间文件' },\n      { name: 'quality', description: '输出质量 (0-100)，仅对某些格式生效' },\n      { name: 'imgname', description: '生成文件名（可选），不含扩展名' },\n      { name: 'format', description: \"图片格式：'png' | 'jpg' | 'jpeg'\" },\n      { name: 'jpegQuality', description: '当 format 为 jpeg/jpg 时使用的质量设置 (0-100)' },\n    ],\n  },\n  \"vuetemplateStr\": {\n    description: 'Vue 模板字符串，用于渲染图片的静态 HTML',\n    type: <code>string</code>,\n  },\n  \"props\": {\n    description: '传入 Vue 模板的属性对象（可选）',\n    type: <code>Record&lt;string, any&gt;</code>,\n    default: <code>{`{}`}</code>,\n  },\n}"},"337":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#使用方法","content":"示例："},"338":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#返回处理","content":"generateImage 方法返回一个包含生成图片信息的对象："},"339":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample/5#返回处理","content":"type: {\n  path: {\n    description:\n      '图片的绝对路径 (如何没有路径就是有缓存使用 file_id 发送图片，避免重复上传)',\n    type: 'string',\n  },\n  width: {\n    description: '图片宽度，单位像素',\n    type: 'number',\n  },\n  height: {\n    description: '图片高度，单位像素',\n    type: 'number',\n  },\n  hash: {\n    description: '图片内容的哈希值',\n    type: 'string',\n  },\n  file_id: {\n    description: '上传到 Telegram 后的文件 ID(当有 path 时表示该参数有缓存图片)',\n    type: 'string',\n  },\n}"},"340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample","type":"page","content":"插件开发帮助","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发指南","开始","插件开发帮助"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample"},"341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/Sample","content":"帮助你快速开始"},"342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/Sample#插件接口一览","content":"插件接口一览"},"343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/Sample-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/Sample","type":"heading","tags":[